@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.TeamSafaModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Safa Adhisya";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <div class="event-hero reveal">
            <div class="event-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Our Team</p>
                <h2>Safa Adhisya</h2>

                <p class="event-intro">
                    A sign language interpreter whose journey at Kopi Cinta deepened
                    her understanding of Deaf culture, communication, and what inclusivity truly asks from all of us.
                </p>

                <div class="event-tags">
                    <span>Interpreter</span>
                    <span>Operations</span>
                    <span>Inclusivity</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="team-profile-hero-img reveal">
                <img src="/images/team/safa.jpg" alt="Safa Adhisya">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">Her Real Journey</p>
                <h3>Stepping Into the World More Deeply</h3>

                <p>
                    For Safa, the world of disability—especially the Deaf community—
                    was not entirely new.
                </p>

                <p>
                    But working directly with Deaf friends at Kopi Cinta made her realize
                    that there were still many dynamics, cultures, and ways of interaction
                    she had yet to fully understand.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-block-card">
                <h4>Her Role</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Sign language interpreter</li>
                    <li>Operational coordination</li>
                    <li>SOP collaboration</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-feature reveal">
            <div class="hbii-feature-card">
                <p class="hbii-label">Process</p>
                <h3>Not Always Easy, But Always Meaningful</h3>

                <p>
                    The process has not always been easy.
                    There have been moments of struggle, uncertainty, and confusion.
                </p>

                <p>
                    But those moments also brought curiosity—
                    a desire to keep learning and understanding more deeply.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-feature-card soft">
                <p class="hbii-label">Understanding</p>
                <h3>Communication Beyond Delivery</h3>

                <p>
                    Through her role, Safa came to understand that communication
                    is not only about delivering messages—
                    but about truly understanding one another.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>Her Reflection</h3>
            <p>
                For Safa, inclusivity does not belong to one individual,
                one brand, or one community.
            </p>
            <p>
                It belongs to all of us.
                Inclusion is not a space we visit—
                it is a responsibility we choose to take.
            </p>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Team</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>